message: >-
  Cite the article for the argument. To cite a specific number, cite the product
  by filename and the first sixteen hex digits of its SHA-256, both printed in the
  article's Data availability statement.
title: >-
  darknet-panel-baselines: derived products and check scripts for the manuscript
  "Baselines and detection floors: what a darknet market panel can and cannot say
  about displacement"
